<title>POLAND: Drosed revises up 1996 net.</title>
<headline>Drosed revises up 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drosed preliminary results for financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 5.44 vs    7.61</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   4.97 vs    8.58</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.34 vs    6.16</p>
<p>    net sales				141.28 vs   91.65</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 118.01 vs   73.23</p>
<p>    extraordinary			     na  vs     na</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.61 vs    2.42</p>
<p>    other taxes				1.03 vs     na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     6.31 vs    4.59</p>
<p>    financial costs			  6.95 vs    3.91</p>
<p>NOTE: Earlier, in its Q4 report, the company said its net profit for 1996 was 1.55 million zlotys. Full company name is Siedleckie Zaklady Drobiarskie Drosed SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
